## Methodology notes

- **Audit scope.** Each audit covers all `unsafe` blocks, `unsafe fn`, `unsafe impl`, `unsafe trait`, `extern` blocks, `asm!`. Soundness surface includes every `pub` item reaching `unsafe`.
- **Bucket discipline.** A/B/C classification per [CLASSIFICATION-RUBRIC.md](../../skills/rust-unsafe-code-exorcist/references/methodology/CLASSIFICATION-RUBRIC.md). (A) requires falsifiable justification; (B) requires per-target perf measurement; (C) requires property-based equivalence proof.
- **Verification.** `verify.sh` runs miri (3 modes) + careful + loom + fuzz + mutants + geiger + full test suite under default + safe-only.
- **Continuous mode.** Per [CONTINUOUS-MODE.md](../../skills/rust-unsafe-code-exorcist/references/methodology/CONTINUOUS-MODE.md). Cron drift checker nightly.

