## Generation

- Auto-appended sections: audit entries, incident entries, refactor wave summary, continuous-mode highlights, cumulative metrics.
- Manually-edited: project metadata (at top), context notes (anywhere appropriate).
- Generation script: `scripts/generate-soundness-changelog.sh <audit-dir> <project>`.
- The script is idempotent: running it twice produces the same output.
